.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-parse 1  "xil-parse " 
.SH NAME
xil\-parse \- Parse production script markdown into structured JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-parse\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-stats\fR] [\fB\-\-speakers\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCRIPT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parse production script markdown into structured JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S01E01) — validates header and auto\-generates absent cast/sfx configs
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01, CH003) — skips season/episode header validation
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output JSON path (default: parsed/parsed_<slug>_<TAG>.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR \fI<PREVIEW>\fR
Show first N dialogue lines (default: show all)
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Only output JSON, skip summary/preview
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Write diagnostic CSV alongside JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-stats\fR
Print per\-speaker dialogue distribution (lines, words, chars, %)
.TP
\fB\-\-speakers\fR \fI<SPEAKERS>\fR
Path to speakers.json (default: auto\-detect from CWD, then built\-in)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISCRIPT\fR>
Path to the production script markdown file
